### 1. Add a Student (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav",
  "course": "B.Tech",
  "age": 20
}

### 2. Add a Second Student (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riya",
  "course": "BCA",
  "age": 19
}

### 3. Get All Students (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students

### 4. Filter by Course (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students?course=B.Tech

### 5. Get Single Student by ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/1

### 6. Update Student (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav",
  "course": "B.Tech",
  "age": 21
}

### 7. Delete Student (200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/students/1